+## 4. Exact cohort / population / missingness
+
+- Failed cycle `e691992d…`: 7 failed dispatches; 4-case frozen cohort.
+- Post-fix cycle `d3aea539…`: universe **458** (345 `claimed_delivery`, 40
+  `government_decision`, 73 `ignored_work`), 4 deep cases (two open, one closed
